---
description: Reconcile a close assertion through source lineage, break ownership and independent signoff.
args: { request: CloseCycleRequest; books: CloseSourceBook }
returns: CloseProgramResult
uses: [closeDesk/traceCloseAssertion, closeDesk/classifyLedgerBreaks, closeDesk/commissionBreakOwners, closeDesk/assembleWorkpaperConclusion, closeDesk/checkIndependentSignoff, closeDesk/invalidateLateJournalScope, closeDesk/compareRegeneratedSource, closeDesk/quarantineBrokenFormula, closeDesk/recordMissedDeadline]
---
Treat each workpaper as an assertion over an entity, period, account set and immutable source editions. Bind scope = `traceCloseAssertion(request, books.workpapers, books.evidencePages)` before comparing amounts. Bind journalImpact = `invalidateLateJournalScope(request, books.lateJournalReceipts, books.priorSignoffs)` and regeneration = `compareRegeneratedSource(request, books.reportRegenerations)`; retain their changed-line findings even when aggregate totals remain equal. Bind formulaGate = `quarantineBrokenFormula(request, books.formulaValidationReceipts)` and deadlineState = `recordMissedDeadline(request, books.deadlineEvents)`. Exclude any formula-derived value that lacks a matching validation receipt for its exact formula, input range and output.

Only when scope has exact source versions and formulaGate has no unresolved computed amount, bind breaks = `classifyLedgerBreaks(scope, books.evidencePages)`. Keep offsetting rows separate. Assign a task only for each material break with an unresolved fact; bind taskQueue = `commissionBreakOwners(request, breaks, books.preparerTransfers)` and preserve the original preparer identity when a successor takes an open task. Otherwise return an empty, explicitly complete queue.

Bind conclusion = `assembleWorkpaperConclusion(scope, breaks, taskQueue, books.evidencePages)` only when all required evidence tasks have completion evidence. Keep verified facts, management explanations and residual amounts distinct. Bind signoffReview = `checkIndependentSignoff(request, scope, conclusion, books.priorSignoffs)` only after the residual schedule is complete; reject reviewer identity equal to the preparer and bind eligibility to the exact source-line and conclusion versions. Return a CloseProgramResult with those bound artifacts, the source-change, formula and deadline guardrails, and commitAllowed false. This application prepares a reviewable workpaper and never posts a journal or captures a signature.